ark names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Popular Aardvark names include classic choices widely loved by pet owners and enthusiasts. For male Aardvarks 🐜, names like Max, Charlie, and Buddy are timeless favorites. For female Aardvarks 🐜, Bella, Luna, and Daisy tend to top the charts. Browse our full collection above to find even more options tailored to your preferences.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How do I choose the best name for my Aardvark?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Choosing the perfect name for your Aardvark 🐜 depends on their personality, appearance, and your personal taste! Observe your Aardvark's unique behaviors — are they playful or calm? Bold or shy? Pick a name that feels right when you say it aloud. Short, 1-2 syllable names often work best as they are easier for animals to recognize and respond to.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can I use human names for my Aardvark?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely! Human names are very popular for Aardvarks 🐜. Names like Oliver, Sophie, Jack, or Emma work wonderfully and add a personal, meaningful touch. Many pet owners prefer human names because they create a stronger emotional connection and feel more like a family member than just a pet.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",nul